   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Green Wednesday 2025: Cape Cod Cannabis",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/25305728-CCC_Logo_650px-geo-tag-1-300x254.jpg\" alt=\"Cape Cod dispensary near me - Cape Cod Cannabis, Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"300\" height=\"254\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/CCC_Logo_650px-geo-tag-1-300x254.jpg?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/1a7e34ec-CCC_Logo_650px-geo-tag-1.jpg\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "What Is Green Wednesday?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Green Wednesday</strong> is the cannabis industry’s own shopping holiday, landing the day before Thanksgiving each year. This is when dispensaries roll out unbeatable <strong>cannabis deals</strong> and customers across the country search <strong><em>dispensary near me</em></strong> to stock up before the festivities begin.</p><p>Whether you’re planning a relaxed night in, prepping for family time, or getting ready for the legendary <em>pre-Thanksgiving walk</em>, Green Wednesday 2025 is the perfect time to explore new strains, try premium flower, or grab that top-shelf concentrate you’ve been eyeing.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "The Rise of Green Wednesday"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Since the early days of legalization, cannabis retailers have seen <strong>massive sales spikes</strong> on the Wednesday before Thanksgiving. Around 2016, dispensaries began offering Green Wednesday specials, and the trend exploded.</p><p>Now, it’s the <strong>second busiest cannabis shopping day of the year</strong>, only surpassed by 4/20. From new customers to seasoned consumers, everyone’s looking for <strong><em>cannabis dispensary deals near me</em></strong> and local shops are delivering.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Why Green Wednesday 2025 Is the Perfect Time to Stock Up"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>With <strong>deals across all product categories</strong>, this is your opportunity to explore everything the modern cannabis market has to offer:</p><ul><li><a href=\"/categories/flower/\"><strong>Top-shelf flower</strong></a><strong> &amp; <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">Pre-Rolls</a> </strong>— premium strains at doorbuster prices</li><li><strong><a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">Concentrates</a> &amp; <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">Vapes</a></strong> — discreet, potent, and portable</li><li><a href=\"/categories/edibles/\"><strong>Edibles &amp; Beverages</strong></a> — perfect for family gatherings or relaxing evenings</li><li><a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\"><strong>Tinctures &amp; Oils</strong></a> — easy, precise dosing for higher-tolerance consumers</li><li><a href=\"/specials/\"><strong>Bundle Your Buzz</strong></a> – bundle your favorite products and save</li><li><a href=\"/menu/\"><strong>Shop Our Menu</strong></a> – shop our entire menu to find what’s right for you</li></ul><p>The deals are as diverse as the products, and Green Wednesday 2025 promises even more <strong>dispensary specials and loyalty rewards</strong> for shoppers searching <strong><em>weed deals near me.</em></strong></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Discreet Cannabis for the Holidays"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Thanksgiving often means spending time with family, and not everyone is cannabis-friendly. Luckily, legalization has brought innovation that makes <strong>discreet consumption</strong> easier than ever.</p><ul><li><strong>Infused beverages</strong> and <strong>water-soluble tinctures</strong> offer quick onset and subtle dosing.</li><li><strong>Single-serve drinks</strong> make for a low-key, social way to enjoy cannabis without smoke or odor.</li><li><strong>Edibles</strong> infused with cannabinoids like <strong>CBG</strong> can promote calm, while <strong>THCv</strong> offers an energetic boost for lively conversation.</li></ul><p>Whether you’re hosting dinner or joining family from out of town, these products make it easy to keep things chill <em>and under the radar</em>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Green Wednesday Savings Tips"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>The exclusive deals on Green Wednesday make it the perfect time to <strong>try something new</strong>:</p><ul><li>Splurge on a <a href=\"/shop-high-testing-flower/\"><strong>high-THC strain</strong></a> or boutique brand you’ve wanted to sample.</li><li>Grab a few friends and enjoy a new <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/single-infused-pre-roll-3/\"><strong>infused joint</strong></a>.</li><li>Opt for <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/cartridges/\"><strong>vaporizer cartridges</strong></a> for a clean, convenient, and discreet option when you’re on the go.</li></ul><p><em>As always, please consume responsibly.</em></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Celebrate the Spirit of Green Wednesday"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>At its heart, <strong>Green Wednesday embodies gratitude </strong>for legal cannabis, community, and the plant itself. Whether you’re trying something new or stocking up on old favorites, it’s a chance to support your local <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis</strong> dispensary, share the love, and blaze responsibly before the big feast.</p><p>So, this year, when you search <strong><em>dispensary near me</em></strong> or <strong><em>recreational cannabis deals near me</em></strong>, you’ll find more than great prices, you’ll find a celebration of the cannabis culture that connects us all at <strong><a href=\"/directions/\">Cape Cod Cannabis, 1446 US-6, Wellfleet, MA</a></strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Address & Contact"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p>Address: <strong><a href=\"/directions/\">Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary, 1446 US-6, Wellfleet, MA 02667</a></strong></p></li><li><p>Phone: (774) 383-3133</p></li><li><p>Location: Located in the Route 6 shopping plaza in South Wellfleet</p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Directions & Access"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p><strong>Cape Cod Cannabis</strong> is located right off Route 6 in South Wellfleet (in the old South Wellfleet General Store location), making it convenient if you’re coming from towns across Cape Cod</p></li><li><p>Parking: We have 26 designated parking spaces plus several free municipal parking spots in the plaza</p></li><li><p>Payment methods &amp; note: We accept cash, debit cards, and CanPay. ATM on site (with small merchant fee for ATM/debit)</p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Cape Cod Cannabis…it’s worth the trip!"
    }
   ]
  },
